# CLARION CALL: what the cartridge keeps. A run is one sitting and is
# never saved; the records are: runs started, gear bought (the original's
# stat), the furthest area reached, and the wins of each kind, shown on the
# title. FULL-PEAL, typed on the code screen, starts runs with eight of the
# sixteen upgrades (the Tin Plate among them), a bar of 16 and a tank of
# 1,600 holding 800; the bar (not the tank) fills again in every area, and
# such runs earn no goals and no records. The dozing tortoise that some
# friendly rooms hold mumbles the code once it has been shot a hundred
# times (the guide's count; the UFO Companion says 200), and once shot it
# shoots back now and then.
seed 1
game clarion
wait 20
expect runs == 0
expect gear_bought == 0
expect best_area == 0
press A
wait 10
expect runs == 1
cheat area 2 1
wait 2
expect runs == 2
expect area_no == 4
cheat coins 500
cheat enter_room 6
wait 2
cheat sub_place 88 144
wait 5
press B 10
wait 30
expect gear_bought == 1
cheat die
wait 120
expect state == 8
wait 100
press A
wait 5
expect state == 0
reload
game clarion
wait 20
expect state == 0
expect runs == 2
expect best_area == 4
expect gear_bought == 1
# the code: F-U-L-L, P-E-A-L
